    "errorCantReachGitHub" : {
      "comment" : "Error message shown when syncing or signing in fails (sync status, sign-in screen, warning notices, list of changes waiting to be sent). The network or GitHub can't be reached. %(detail)@ is the system's reason, a sentence such as 'The Internet connection appears to be offline.'",
